abitadas\n• 3 suítes\n• 323 m² privativos\n• 4 vagas de garagem\n• Garagem com pintura epóxi\n• Áreas comuns equipadas e decoradas\n• Piscina externa e piscina coberta\n• Fitness Center\n• Fire Place\n• Brinquedoteca\n• Salão de festas\n• Mini quadra esportiva\n• Sauna, sala de massagem e espaços de relaxamento\n• Consciência ambiental\n• Certificação ISO 9001\n• Patrimônio de afetação (mais segurança ao comprador)","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/692e17da1ef828896e0c8cd9/pilar-homes-images-watermark/11c8c381-21a4-4ed0-afdf-7a4f790b3999.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/692e17da1ef828896e0c8cd9/pilar-homes-images-watermark/deae3c85-8138-4d32-84f0-137c18b640fe.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/692e17da1ef828896e0c8cd9/pilar-homes-images-watermark/511602e8-c305-445b-b55a-083fb619dc22.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/692e17da1ef828896e0c8cd9/pilar-homes-images-watermark/1eab8c8a-660a-4eb1-83fc-6a29ad07f941.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/692e17da1ef828896e0c8cd9/pilar-homes-images-watermark/493c31b7-b292-4265-a1f1-f1ef42adbbc6.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/692e17da1ef828896e0c8cd9/pilar-homes-images-watermark/03c7156c-8660-48a8-b37e-a06d0d7d9202.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/692e17da1ef828896e0c8cd9/pilar-homes-images-watermark/6290c3f6-1872-4492-872e-e74469b72d79.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/692e17da1ef828896e0c8cd9/pilar-homes-images-watermark/97354455-ef94-4e55-99d4-fbf0c7f3b003.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/692e17da1ef828896e0c8cd9/pilar-homes-images-watermark/642f6dab-ac2c-4205-aaa2-f0294c789684.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/692e17da1ef828896e0c8cd9/pilar-homes-images-watermark/558260ca-13ac-4ad7-81f0-96e42f4e7ae6.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/692e17da1ef828896e0c8cd9/pila